The fixture checks four operators, full-width inputs/results, signed truncation
towards zero, minimum/one, minimum/minimum, unsigned maximum, compound stores,
once-only addresses and live register pairs across helper calls/stack arguments.
Undefined zero-divisor and minimum/-1 cases are interpreter diagnostic tests,
not reference-value probes.
